{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Duocamly 是一款雙鏡頭與雙格式錄影應用程式，專為需要同時發佈長片與短片的創作者、YouTuber、Vlogger、手機記者與教學人員而設。它讓用戶一次拍攝就取得橫向與直向版本，省去裁切、改變比例與重拍。原價 US $9.99 的終生版現正限時免費，內購限時免費中，適合經常在 YouTube 與社交平台同步發佈內容的用戶。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-152.webp\">\n<h2>雙格式同步錄製與提詞器</h2>\n<p>Duocamly 可同時錄製橫向與直向影片，一次拍攝即產生適合 YouTube 的橫向片段，以及適合 TikTok、Reels 與 Shorts 的直向片段，毋須事後裁切或重拍。前後鏡頭可同步開啟，方便拍攝反應、訪問與幕後花絮；內置提詞器讓用戶閱讀長篇講稿時仍能直視鏡頭。程式另支援 4K 影片、水平儀與地平線輔助線，拍攝完成即可直接匯出發佈。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-41-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-42-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-43-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-44-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-45-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-46-scaled.jpg\">\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>1：Dual Camera Recorder: Duocamly 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶進入設定後選 Unlimited Access。</p>\n<img alt=\"IMG 5903\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/IMG_5903-473x1024.webp\">\n<p>2：選「有優惠碼」</p>\n<img alt=\"IMG 5904\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/IMG_5904-473x1024.webp\">\n<p>3：輸入 DUOCAMLY16 後兌換。</p>\n<img alt=\"IMG 5905\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/IMG_5905-473x1024.webp\">\n<p>4：看到 Lifetime 為免費即可收下。</p>\n<img alt=\"IMG 5906\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/IMG_5906-473x1024.webp\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Dual Camera Recorder: Duocamly</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.268821+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":555,"images":11,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T14:20:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T14:57:46.161027+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:16.694145+00:00","content_hash":"0340de1c732d9fa7e9a3aab6602e4421e12cdad2f24069c26927ac667ca70618","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}